# This file is a reference index only — each service reads its OWN .env file.
# Copy the corresponding .env.example in each folder and fill it in:
#
#   server/.env.example              -> server/.env
#   client/.env.example              -> client/.env
#   python-monitoring/.env.example   -> python-monitoring/.env
#
# Summary of what lives where:
#
# server/.env
#   PORT, NODE_ENV, MONGO_URI, JWT_SECRET, JWT_EXPIRES_IN,
#   RESET_TOKEN_EXPIRES_MIN, CLIENT_URL, PYTHON_MONITORING_URL, MAX_UPLOAD_MB
#
# client/.env
#   VITE_API_URL, VITE_SOCKET_URL
#
# python-monitoring/.env
#   PORT, NODE_SERVER_URL, YOLO_MODEL_PATH, PHONE_DETECTION_CONFIDENCE

# Run Python-Monitoring with the following command:
# uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload